sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as 用户
  participant W as WelcomeView
  participant O as FirstTaskOnboarding
  participant S as Renderer Store
  participant L as Local Compute API existing
  participant P as Provider API existing
  participant G as SettingsPage
  participant X as Session API existing
  participant C as Workbench lifecycle
  participant R as Result API existing
  participant B as Workbench openPanel
  participant V as StudioResultPanel
  participant A as Acceptance Review API existing

  Note over O: 仅持久化版本、candidate、里程碑、完成或跳过
  Note over O: 不存 prompt、cwd、path、URI、Provider、Session、Result 或 Acceptance 副本

  W->>S: 读取 providersHydrated 和 providers
  alt Provider 尚未水合
    W-->>U: 显示检测算力
    S->>P: refreshProviders()
    P-->>S: ProviderView[]
    S->>S: providersHydrated=true
  end

  alt hasAvailableCompute(providers)
    S-->>W: 可用 Provider 或现有全局路由
    W->>O: milestone(compute_ready)
  else Assistant 无可用算力
    W->>L: activateLocalCompute()
    Note over W,L: 同时请求共享同一 Promise
    alt activated + provider
      L-->>W: provider
      W->>W: providerId=provider.id, model=AUTO_MODEL
      W->>O: computeSource=local, compute_ready
    else unavailable 或异常
      L-->>W: unavailable/error
      W-->>U: 重试检测 / 配置 Provider
      opt 用户配置 Provider
        U->>W: 点击配置 Provider
        W->>S: 保存 WelcomeDraft 到 renderer 内存
        W->>S: setShowSettings(true, providers)
        Note over W,G: App 条件渲染使 Welcome 卸载
        S-->>G: 打开现有 Provider tab
        U->>G: 新增或修复并保存 Provider
        G->>P: 现有 Provider 保存和测试链路
        G->>S: refreshProviders()
        G->>S: setShowSettings(false)
        S-->>W: Welcome 重挂载并恢复内存草稿
      end
    end
  end

  U->>W: 选择真实目录与推荐预设或自定义输入
  W->>W: 从 WELCOME_TOOLS 读取原始 promptKey 和 taskStrategy
  W->>W: busy + submitPending 防重入
  W->>S: startSessionWithPrompt(options, prompt)
  S->>X: createSession + send first message
  X-->>S: Session 已创建并首发
  S-->>W: resolve, activeId 指向新 Session
  W->>O: candidateSessionId + first_task_started
  W-->>U: 进入聊天并显示轻量任务进度

  loop 仅观察 candidateSessionId
    C->>S: 读取 candidate SessionMeta.status
    alt starting 或 running
      C-->>U: 不覆盖聊天、策略、权限、审批和中断
    else error 或 closed
      C-->>U: 不完成，可继续或重新开始
    else idle 可审查
      C->>O: compare-and-set 自动打开标记
      alt 尚未自动处理
        C->>R: getStudioResultSnapshot(candidateSessionId)
        R-->>C: StudioResultSnapshot
        alt snapshot.state == ready
          C->>S: 确保 candidate Session 为 active
          C->>B: openPanel('result')
          B->>B: activePanelId=result, mountedPanels keep-alive
          C->>O: resultAutoOpenedForSessionId + first_result_opened
        else unbound 或请求失败
          C-->>U: 保持 reviewing_result 并给现有下一步
        end
      else 已自动打开
        C-->>U: 不重复抢焦点
      end
    end
  end

  B-->>V: 渲染 result 面板, sessionId=activeId
  V->>R: getStudioResultSnapshot(sessionId)
  R-->>V: 最新 snapshot
  V-->>U: Summary / Artifacts / Evidence / Timeline

  U->>V: 打开 available Artifact location
  V->>S: 调用现有 Preview/Browser/Diff/Files action
  S-->>V: open Promise resolve
  V->>O: firstArtifactOpenedAt + locationId

  alt Acceptance pending 或 failed
    U->>V: 选择 Evidence 并 review，或填写理由 waived
    V->>A: reviewWorkflowAcceptance(existing input)
    A-->>V: review result
    V->>R: refresh getStudioResultSnapshot(sessionId)
    R-->>V: Acceptance 真源已更新
  end

  V->>O: evaluate latest snapshot
  alt 已打开 available Artifact 且全部 Acceptance passed 或合法 waived
    O->>O: completedAt + first_acceptance_resolved, first-write-wins
    O-->>U: 首任务 completed
  else 零或不可用 Artifact，或 Acceptance 缺失/pending/failed
    O-->>U: 保持 reviewing_result，显示缺口与现有工具入口
  end

  Note over C,R: 重启恢复只重新观察 candidate 与快照，绝不再次 startSessionWithPrompt
  Note over B,V: 用户切到其他面板后不自动重复打开 result
